+ * Ethernet in the DFU loader, like the other XBurst1 loaders: the
+ * MAC-PHY clock derives from the per-variant MPLL via the CGU clk
+ * driver. No PHY reset GPIO here - board-specific; a wired-ethernet
+ * board DT declares its own ingenic,reset-gpio.
+ */
